---
import { getWateringPlacements } from "../../lib/watering-placement.mjs";
import "../../styles/tools/watering-map.css";

const placements = await getWateringPlacements();
---

<section
    class="watering-map card"
    id="watering-map"
    aria-labelledby="watering-map-title"
    data-placements={JSON.stringify(placements)}
>
    <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Your watering log, at a glance</p>
        <h2 id="watering-map-title">Days since watering</h2>
        <p>
            Each pot’s place shows the number of calendar days since its last recorded Water event.
            Counts update from the published log when you open this page and every five minutes
            while it is visible. These are observations, not a watering schedule.
        </p>
    </header>
    <div class="watering-map-actions" aria-label="Watering map controls">
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-refresh">
            Refresh data
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-png" disabled>
            Download PNG
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-svg" disabled>
            Download SVG
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-enlarge" aria-pressed="false">
            Enlarge image
        </button>
    </div>
    <p id="watering-map-source" class="watering-map-source" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        Loading published watering observations…
    </p>
    <p
        id="watering-map-export-status"
        class="watering-map-export-status"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
    ></p>
    <figure class="watering-map-figure">
        <div
            class="watering-map-viewport"
            tabindex="0"
            role="region"
            aria-label="Watering placement image; enlarge to scroll horizontally"
        >
            <img
                id="watering-map-image"
                alt="Recorded table placement with days since watering for each pot; equivalent details follow below."
                hidden
            />
        </div>
        <figcaption>
            The layout follows the photos supplied October 22, with front and rear tables shown
            separately. Other locations and unconfirmed placements appear in their own group. The
            gray/blue rosette at the back still needs an identity confirmation. A logged move is
            listed in the details; free-text locations cannot update diagram coordinates. “Unknown”
            means no active Water event was recorded. The full map fits your screen; use Enlarge
            image for a closer view with sideways scrolling, or open the readable pot details below.
        </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details class="watering-map-details">
        <summary>Watering and placement details for every pot</summary>
        <ul id="watering-map-pot-list" aria-label="Watering details by pot"></ul>
    </details>
    <noscript>
        Enable JavaScript to load the watering log and generate a downloadable image.
    </noscript>
</section>
<script>
    import "../../client/tools/watering-map.js";
</script>
